      "writtenOn": "2024-01-11T17:17:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "With regards to `DEBUG_LIST`, do we still need it for v6.6 now that `LIST_HARDENED` has been introduced and doesn\u0027t depend on `DEBUG_LIST`? Refer to https://lore.kernel.org/all/20230811151847.1594958-3-elver@google.com/ which seems to indicate that we can get a throughput perf improvement of ~7%.\n\nRegarding `BUG_ON_DATA_CORRUPTION`, since that config has been enabled for some time now, I\u0027ll keep it set.",
      "parentUuid": "005c4c8a_5e24df86",
